# Copy to courier.env (gitignored) and fill in. The wrapper auto-loads it
# (shared couriers/courier.env first, then this package's courier.env).
#
# Where the standalone youtube-clipping engine checkout lives. The wrapper
# runs its .venv's `ycp` from that repo root (ycp resolves config/, data/,
# and its own .env from there). Only set this if the engine lives somewhere
# non-default.
#OCEAN_YT_CLIPPER_ENGINE_DIR=/Users/ericcromartie/Documents/Development/youtube-clipping

# Optional: 1Password secret reference for the DeepSeek hook-agent key. The
# wrapper resolves it at runtime via `op read` (mirroring the engine's own
# scripts/autopilot.sh) — the key itself never lands on disk. If unset, the
# engine falls back to its transcript heuristic for hook titles.
#DEEPSEEK_OP_REF=op://Private/DeepSeek/credential

# No other tokens belong in this package. Postiz / Slack QC / Gemini / YouTube
# creds live in the engine repo's gitignored .env, loaded by ycp itself.
